# What `gcloud run deploy --source` uploads: only the files the image needs.
# An allowlist: gcloud does not read .git/info/exclude, so files excluded only there would be uploaded.
# A bare * matches at every depth, so a re-included folder needs its contents re-included too.
# Check the result with: gcloud meta list-files-for-upload .
*
!Dockerfile
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!app/
!app/**
!static/
!static/**
__pycache__/
